// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P2081449311" "We survived the Wars. We survived his betrayal. We'll survive this too. This city's gonna be ours!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P4218473521" "Cole and his cronies left us to die out there. It's time for some payback!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P71968703" "I'm looking forward to bringing Cole and White to their knees. When we're done, this city will belong to the Destroyers!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P2620420141" "We fought off the end of the world, but Cole's boys think they're tough? I say we show 'em what real toughness is!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P875611535" "If we'd had this Fixodine stuff during the wars, there's no way they'd have betrayed us."

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P3001621005" "If you were lookin' for a fight, you've found one. Hope you're ready to die!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P4263508268" "I'm going to enjoy tearing you apart!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P372310959" "You really think you've got any chance of stopping us?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P2259103825" "I've been itching for a fight for hours. Time to bring the pain!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P3741810318" "What do you think you're going to do to us? We're unstoppable!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P2871950671" "No surrender! No retreat! Only victory!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P3184764366" "I'm going to tear your arms out!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2086190504" "We've got enough payload to level this city. Why're we only hitting one building?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3092850397" "When this goes up, Cole's going to know we mean business!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1738388548" "I've been waitin' a long time for this! They won't know what hit 'em!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1693464435" "Time to set this town on fire!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2585625972" "Looking good! We're gonna be ready to go soon!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3775653290" "After this blows, I'm thinkin' of takin' some hostages. Who's with me?"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2935253572" "Looks like we've found the bomb's first victim!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1199959707" "Get that runt and strap 'em to the bomb!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1309005587" "We're sending a message to Cole, and you're not gonna stop us!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3700393692" "Rrrrr! We're not letting you get in our way!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3319864706" "If we don't get you, the bomb will! Either way, you've made your last mistake!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4282152966" "I'm gonna enjoy splattering you on the pavement!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2588253536" "We need to be fast. No mistakes. Keep it together unless we get in an engagement. If we miss this shipment, we've gotta push the operation back six months."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3517156020" "You fools better get it together! Keep this ragin' for when we need it! Those PPD ain't just going to give up White's location!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4265979277" "Look, I know you guys are itchin' for a fight, but we gotta stick to the plan. We're not thugs! Discipline!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P593354043" "Now's not the time for playin' games. We've gotta strike fast and hard. Load up before we go, and you'll smash through those walls like they're paper!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P742574496" "Why'd you have to go stickin' your nose in? Now I'm gonna have to take your head off!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1009307196" "Looks like we'll get some practice in before the mission. Take 'em out!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4122112415" "Raaagh! I've had enough of this! Start with this one and level the block!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P484596080" "Time for some bone-breakin'!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3133210142" "Lookin' to get more crush? Then guess where it's hidden."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2734213330" "You win, you get the crush. I win, and you gimme what you got. Interested?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3507113379" "Don't try smashin' the table if you lose. I'll rip your head off!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P46007600" "Lucky today! Wanna go double or nothin'?"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2572243957" "Looks like it's our lucky day. Time to fight"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4136334244" "I'm winnin' and you mess up the game! You're gonna pay! Rrrrr!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1218985142" "Free play for the first one to take down this chump!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2147669951" "It just isn't your lucky day!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3241073911" "Where do you hide yours? In your shoe? This ain't like that. It's fresh from the glass."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3510015914" "You're lookin' a bit scrawny. Sure you don't need to get yourself some fresh crush?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P601970100" "If we're going to destroy Cole, we need to stay strong and this is how we do it. How much you want?"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P894492005" "These 'citizens'. Always stickin' their nose in where it doesn't belong. How 'bout I break it off, 'citizen'?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2919200788" "Your Emperor ain't here to help you now!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1627197977" "I'm going to enjoy breaking you into pieces!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3663289864" "Raaagh! You're in for a world of hurt now, fool!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3723543816" "I'll take whatever you got. We've got a big operation tonight."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3868923074" "I don't know. Last guy who bought from you exploded with rage. Literally."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3925158119" "I'm not lookin' for any now. I'm lookin' for someone who can get us some intel. Know anyone?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P304795384" "I'm good for now, but I do need someone to help us raid the PPD later. Interested?"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P526567037" "We'll finish this later. Let's smash this fool first!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3698527708" "I've been hopin' one of you would stumble in here! Now I get to smash!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1751370298" "These 'citizens' make me sick. I say we kill 'em all, starting with this one!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2356987323" "This one looks tough! Take 'em down fast!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3943107507" "Face it, 'citizen', your Emperor doesn't care! You belong to us now!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P2779466721" "Looks like he ain't comin'! No one's going to save you now!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P313007333" "You're coming with us. We're gonna make you one of us!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3010349848" "That was the last thing you'll ever see in this city!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P674444188" "So you want to mess with us, eh? Bad move!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P123510123" "Your head's going to look good on my wall!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P539642052" "Looks like this one wants to get captured!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P3701732762" "I bet this one will be worth more for ransom!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P544025354" "Rrrrr! You look ready to die!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P1677451882" "Please! I just want to go home to my family!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P2005545439" "I... I don't believe you! The Emperor will ensure my safety!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P762857936" "Don't do this, please!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P3921164620" "I'm begging you... let me go! I promise not to say anything!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P3852389477" "I don't have anything for you! Please, just let me go!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P3265922688" "In the name of Emperor Cole, I am placing you under arrest."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P4099464224" "You'd better let me go or you're all going to be dead."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P3359256858" "I'm not saying anything or taking you anywhere. I'd rather die than betray my Emperor."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1745568707" "I've got nothing to say to you. Stand down now and maybe I'll let you live."

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P330861417" "You're going to take us to White. If you don't, we'll rip your arms off, OK?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P3781595313" "Tell us how to get into the Precinct or I'll put your head through that wall!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P2985143060" "You'll only end up dead when your 'Emperor' doesn't pay the ransom, so just tell us now!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P3503107063" "Your 'Emperor' will abandon you like he abandoned us. Then you'll join us."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P4018582162" "We're gonna win because we're stronger and we're tougher. This is your last chance to join us."

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_ALERT :
"P98372548" "Leave the cop. This one's looking for a fight!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_ALERT :
"P3598651069" "Bring this one down!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_ALERT :
"P2431450551" "Rrrrr! No more patience! Everyone's going down!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_ALERT :
"P2714011589" "We fought the Hamidon. Do you really think you've got any chance?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_ALERT :
"P3515696408" "Send this one to the morgue!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_RES_INACTIVE :
"P2676378673" "We're fightin' the scampers too! You don't need to steal me!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_RES_INACTIVE :
"P4286929727" "Big Bad Cole's looking for our hidey-holes too! It's our gig too!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_RES_INACTIVE :
"P3028289743" "We got the same gig, smasher, so just let me mosey."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_RES_INACTIVE :
"P1842481233" "I won't be pushin' up daisies. Cut and run, smasher, if you got any hope for sunshine."

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_INACTIVE :
"P3904660998" "Rrrrr! Start talkin' straight or I'll just smash you here!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_INACTIVE :
"P1108433448" "Rrraghh! We're going to be the ones that finish Cole, not you!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_INACTIVE :
"P3366490784" "Look, you're in our way. If you're in our way, you're gonna get crushed."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_INACTIVE :
"P269556619" "Cole's ours. So, if you won't get out of our way, we'll just smash you too!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_ALERT :
"P2437476455" "Forget the grunt. We got a better fight over here!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_ALERT :
"P854016245" "Time for a workout!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_ALERT :
"P342888951" "I wonder how many of your bones I'll break with the first punch!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_ALERT :
"P2333723391" "Rrrrr! I've had enough of this. Make 'em all cold!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P854301584" "Stupid grunts. You don't know what fightin' is. I'm gonna crush you."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P2579796505" "Rage? I'm going to show you what it really means to rage!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P2750935590" "You really don't know how dead you are, do you?"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P4038376258" "Rrrrr! Get out of my way or I'll crush you!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P2160183846" "You guys think you're so tough with your shiny armor and hand cannons. You're nothing compared to us!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P604689871" "This isn't over. I'm just getting warmed up."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P3700570383" "Think you've won, cop? You don't know it yet, but you're already dead."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P737552422" "I bet I smash your head in before you get off a shot!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTER_INACTIVE :
"P507673464" "That hurt? I'm not even angry yet!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTER_INACTIVE :
"P410484915" "Feel the pain, grunt!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTER_INACTIVE :
"P483825038" "Rrraagh! Now I'm really mad!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTER_INACTIVE :
"P556731240" "I'm going to rip your arms off!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTER_ALERTED :
"P64531743" "Rrraagh! I was hopin' some fool would start something!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTER_ALERTED :
"P3968126438" "I'm going to put you through the wall!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTER_ALERTED :
"P2009840558" "This is gonna be fun! Smash everything! Raaaggh!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE :
"P715451390" "Grunt, meet bat. Bat, meet grunt's head!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE :
"P1862153682" "I'm looking to hit a homerun with your head, so stop moving!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE :
"P4089380599" "I like the sound your bones make when they crack!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE :
"P2321307113" "All your bones are gonna break before this bat does! Hope you're ready to die!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERBLUNT_ALERTED :
"P4102421123" "You're gonna regret this, punk!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERBLUNT_ALERTED :
"P2270510243" "If you think you're gonna win, you're sorely mistaken!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERBLUNT_ALERTED :
"P592404264" "Time to die!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERBLUNT_ALERTED :
"P4178250772" "Rraaaaagh!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE :
"P3128169326" "The sharp end's going in your heart, grunt!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE :
"P3337905938" "I'm going to enjoy cutting you to shreds!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE :
"P4236188951" "This knife's gonna cut through your armor like butter!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE :
"P4042431921" "I'm gonna carve you up in to little pieces when I'm done with you!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERKNIFE_ALERTED :
"P3062396328" "My knife's gonna run red today!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERKNIFE_ALERTED :
"P3523020454" "Cops, grunts, and citizens! So much to fight!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERKNIFE_ALERTED :
"P4215532399" "You're not getting away alive!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERKNIFE_ALERTED :
"P1738151041" "Rrraaagh!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P1540467052" "How've you grunts survived this long? You fight like kids!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P350542289" "That's the rage! Feel it! Feel your insides collapse!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P519243486" "That sounds like a bone cracking. You're not gonna last much longer, grunt!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P1098075410" "I fought in the Wars! You can't win!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERLOW_ALERTED :
"P3242222139" "Rrraaaggh! You have no idea who you're dealing with!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERLOW_ALERTED :
"P4051453736" "You've just made the biggest mistake of your life!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERLOW_ALERTED :
"P3551171804" "I'm going to destroy you! Rrrrraagggh!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_RES_FIGHTERLOW_ALERTED :
"P4066873371" "I'm going to tear you apart!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTER_INACTIVE :
"P140145723" "You cops and your armor. It just means I'll crush you like a tin can."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTER_INACTIVE :
"P2306865952" "All the armor in the world won't save you."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTER_INACTIVE :
"P1575280375" "Rrraaaggh! You're done now!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTER_INACTIVE :
"P1226433083" "This is the last fight you're ever gonna have!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTER_INACTIVE :
"P91350029" "You can't stop me! You can't stop us! This city's going to fall!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTER_ALERTED :
"P3382750307" "If it ain't cops, it's citizens! I'm gonna crush you all!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTER_ALERTED :
"P3432216358" "You ain't gonna see another day, punk!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTER_ALERTED :
"P2985549217" "Rraaagh! Must destroy everything!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTER_ALERTED :
"P3555670073" "There's nothin' that's gonna save you now! Rrraaaghh!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE :
"P3424774391" "All that armor's gonna do is make this take longer!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERBLUNT_INACTIVE :
"P811801050" "Rrraaagh! I'm gonna smash you to pieces!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERBLUNT_ALERTED :
"P784720559" "Rrraaggh! Smash! Destroy!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERBLUNT_ALERTED :
"P1079705911" "You're going to be a stain on the wall!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERBLUNT_ALERTED :
"P321274926" "You shouldn't have gotten in the middle of this! Now you're gonna die too!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERBLUNT_ALERTED :
"P2598945858" "Rrraagggh! You're gonna regret this!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE :
"P3712470584" "You're gonna bleed. It doesn't matter how much armor you've got!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE :
"P147442460" "That's what it feels like when your armor fails! Bleed!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE :
"P3391859748" "First, we take you out. Then, we take over the city!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERKNIFE_INACTIVE :
"P614972234" "That's gonna be a bleeder! You don't have long now!"


// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P431469511" "You cops still don't get it! We're stronger and we know all your moves! You can't win!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P4063834755" "Rrrrr! I've had enough of you!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P1606759087" "Rrraaagh! You're out of time now!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P649609169" "You'd better just run away, cop. You can't win! Rraaagh!"


// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P2088429892" "This is the place. Just keep it together until we're inside!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P2691202689" "Rrraagh! Hurry up! We need to smash!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P1186921956" "I don't see any cops. I thought we'd get a fight! There better be some action inside!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P3502194581" "Rrraagh! I'm gonna beat you if you don't get us in there soon!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P751254185" "Big mistake! Now you're gonna pay! Rrraaagh!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P809192028" "I was hopin' someone would interfere! Time to smash!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P955898252" "No one's gonna save you! You're ours now!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P518859883" "Rrraaagh! Looks like someone's got a death wish!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3371813397" "You got the information we asked for? We gotta get movin' on this!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P837658616" "We want to get movin'. Tell us what you got!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P716758823" "You're the one getting us intel, remember? You're getting paid pretty well for this."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4288003030" "I hope the intel is good. We're lookin' to take 'em down quickly."

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P228053984" "You've just made the last mistake you're ever gonna make!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P972090489" "Rrraaaghh! Take 'em down!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2293023472" "Get rid of this punk! No witnesses!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3272969740" "We got a mess to clean up! Take 'em all down!"

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1262790369" "I'm tellin' you, it's not as easy as you think. White's well-protected!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1152318304" "Look, the Praetor isn't going to just let you in you know. You're going to need help on the inside."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4077866440" "Well, it looks like you may have a shot at them after all, but you're going to have to pull it off without a hitch."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P297568645" "I'm not feeling very comfortable about this. Sure, I want them gone too, but there's gotta be another way."

// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P34997147" "I gotta get outta here. Take care of that one. They've seen my face."
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1433822575" "I knew I shouldn't have trusted you guys! Now I'm going to get killed!"
// NOVA_PRAETORIA_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2000061731" "This is what happens when you go against the Emperor! I'm out of here!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P2997882219" "Make it easier on yourself. Let us in!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P3749600803" "Let us in before we let ourselves in!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P414395839" "Rrraaagh! You're outta time. We're smashin' in!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P23434475" "Rrraagh! Enough! We're comin' in!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P2337659960" "Rrraaagh! Why's someone always gettin' in the way!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P1518839475" "Rrraagh! Looks like there's more to fight!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P1588319374" "You're gonna regret stickin' your nose into this."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_RAIDHIDEOUT_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P1770436261" "I hope you're ready for some pain!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P1808811748" "I'm not sayin' that we'd have been better off if the Hamidon won. But I am sayin' we shouldn't have trusted Cole and White as much as we did."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P1135924028" "After all we did for these people, we're the ones who're the exiles. It makes me sick. It makes me angry! Rrraaagh!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P686938366" "Do you think these people would abandon Cole if they knew the truth?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P2428156535" "We fought. We bled. We died. And for what? So Cole can sit in his tower and tyrannize the world? He's not better than the Hamidon!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P4139354760" "Rrraaagh! I just want to tear it all down!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P1881221935" "Rrraaagh! Time for talkin's done! Time to fight!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P1028766142" "I'm gonna enjoy breaking your legs!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P517231647" "You're not gonna live throught this!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P1722433384" "Rrraagh! Take 'em down!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2044245399" "That's not your concern. We'll take care of it."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1945868598" "Rrrraagh! That's for us to worry about!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2754019444" "Does it look like I care what you're worried about? Let us deal with it."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P575280600" "Rrraagh! Spare us the commentary. We got this!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3793692862" "Rrraagh! You shouldn't be here!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2125515848" "Rrraaagh! I'm gonna tear you apart!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2606481540" "Spying on us is a bad idea."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_DESSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3893041483" "You picked the wrong people to mess with!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4193591253" "You have no idea how well protected the Praetors are. It's going to be harder than you think."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P974514383" "The Syndicate is wealthy and they're well armed. I'd say they're as much a threat to you as the PPD."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3016774403" "What're you gonna do when you beat Cole? What's gonna happen to Praetoria?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2260387359" "This intel was hard to come by. Whatever it is you're planning better succeed!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1620946222" "I'm outta here! I never signed on for the fighting!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3165021819" "This is way more than I bargained for. I'm gone!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P718371534" "I don't want to die!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_INFORMANT_CITIZENSPEAK_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1608430113" "I'm not staying to see how this ends!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1173252060" "We have to get this down quickly and get out. I don't want to be here when it goes off."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2742364190" "Rraaagh! Stop jabbering. If I do this wrong, we're all gonna die!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3927073885" "This is delicate work. Don't rush me!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3612650649" "It's almost done. We gotta run as soon as we get it set."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1058248057" "We're outta time. Get it set, take out this fool, and let's get out of here."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2390026089" "Rraaagh! Hurry up! We got trouble!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2230869716" "I know what they're sayin'. They're sayin' we're criminals and terrorists. That's why we gotta take over TPN. Change the message!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3077618874" "Rrraaagh! Don't make me say this again! We're not gonna just kill people! We need them!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3846406654" "Rrraaagh! If this is how it has to be, then let's just get it over with!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3771102006" "Keep your discipline! We have to execute this flawlessly. No flare-ups! No rampages!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P265246861" "OK. Change of plan. Eliminate the spy!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2102321653" "Take 'em down. Who knows what they heard!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2864742163" "Rrraaagh! Smash first, plan later!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2513646710" "Rrraaagh! Let's take care of this first!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P192491773" "Follow the crush! Think you can find it?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3769033825" "Where's the crush? Think you know? Then it's bettin' time!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2800943482" "It's simple. You bet. You pick the one with the crush. You win or you lose. What's it gonna be?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P510711202" "Looks like you got me that time. Wanna go double or nothin'?"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2916171045" "Game's over. We got ourselves some trouble!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2677604538" "I'll hold these for safekeeping. Let's take this one down!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_GAMBLING_DEALER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1537895126" "Rrraaagh! I'll take bets on who's gonna win!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4177663502" "This is the freshest crush in the city. That's why it's so much."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1748868542" "Look, I'm giving you the best deal I can. Take it or leave it."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2469967342" "If you don't want 'em from me, where else you gonna go?"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1737341513" "Time's up. We have a situation to deal with!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P964399371" "Rrraaagh! Just as I'm about to close the deal!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_SELLER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1588700572" "I'm just tryin' to do a little business here. Why're you getting in the way?"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4124281540" "I don't know. This seems more expensive than I'm used to."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3895435816" "Is this really what it cost you?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2692145543" "Rrrrr! Are you tryin' to rob me? That's too much."

// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1060618884" "Talk to me after we deal with this."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P287465067" "I'm not buyin' anything now. We have other problems."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_ALLHOODS_DES_SHADYDEAL_BUYER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2458314511" "Looks like this is gonna have to wait 'til we smash this fool!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_TRAINING_DRILLSARGE_INACTIVE :
"P3523514787" "We have to keep sharp! Don't let the crush take over your mind!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_TRAINING_DRILLSARGE_INACTIVE :
"P4217048514" "We're the best at fightin' wars and that's why we'll win this one, as long as you keep focused!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_TRAINING_DRILLSARGE_INACTIVE :
"P1674078277" "Rrrrr! Fight tougher! Show no mercy!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_TRAINING_DRILLSARGE_ACTIVE :
"P2530868373" "This is it! Show me what you're made of!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_TRAINING_DRILLSARGE_ACTIVE :
"P724165178" "Rrraaagh! I'm not gonna let you escape!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_TRAINING_DRILLSARGE_ACTIVE :
"P3489319180" "Looks like we'll have some live target practice today!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P1420499776" "Please, I don't want to go with you. Just let me go!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P2787630980" "I don't know anything! Please just let me go!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P3350803214" "You don't have to do this!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CITIZEN_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P1558600908" "No, please! I just want to go home!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P1227687358" "You're coming with us. Quit whining!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P937198452" "If you want to go free, just tell us all you know!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P1721774263" "Rrraaagh! Want to go? Then tell us!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P2626226208" "Rrraaagh! Don't make me hurt you!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P1622131239" "Looks like someone wants to save the day? You're gonna regret that."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P4006603094" "Rraaaagh! I'm gonna smash you!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P2737088826" "You shouldn't have gotten involved!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P2463688038" "Now you're gonna die!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1038346564" "You Destroyers are traitors. You will never get away with this."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1985839844" "Praetor White knows all about you. He knows your weaknesses. He's coming for you."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P3907274756" "You think the PPD is scared of you? Do you think I'm scared of you? You're pathetic traitors!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P2316115095" "You're the traitors. We fought so you could have your precious city and we were betrayed!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P3280519355" "We know so many of Cole's dirty secrets. We're gonna make you tell us more!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1168113007" "Rrraaagh! You know nothing about any of that!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P992129459" "Rrrraaaagh! You shut-up now or I'll crush your skull!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_ALERT :
"P3865453252" "Rrrraagh! Take everyone out! No one lives!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_ALERT :
"P3725671794" "Enough of this!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_ALERT :
"P2956501192" "This is what I've been waiting for all day!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_PPD_ALERT :
"P683471704" "Rrraaaagh! Time to smash it all!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_RES_INACTIVE :
"P2101037888" "C'mon, smasher. I'm no badger. Lemme go!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_RES_INACTIVE :
"P3348538094" "Do I look like a blueberry to you, smasher? Just let me dash and it'll be sunny!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_RES_INACTIVE :
"P3120910383" "Why're you all blood and juice? Spend a lot of ticks in the star? I should get to my hidey-hole so's I don't look like a smasher!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_INACTIVE :
"P178665084" "Rrraaagh! I might just let you go so you'll shut-up!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_INACTIVE :
"P559556830" "Believe me, grunt, this is harder on me than it is on you. I have to listen to you!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_INACTIVE :
"P1354852498" "Rrraaagh! Shut-up already!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_INACTIVE :
"P4271999527" "Is this how you plan to defeat Cole? Jabber at him until he jumps from his tower?"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_INACTIVE :
"P968691278" "Rrraaagh! Enough! Quiet! My head!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_ALERT :
"P1401009627" "Rrrraghh! Enough! Kill 'em all!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_ALERT :
"P1830569411" "You want a fight, you got one!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_ALERT :
"P449928294" "Rrraagh! Time to smash!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_RES_ALERT :
"P2396014526" "I'm so going to enjoy crushing the life out of you!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P1385741180" "It would be wise for you to let me go."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P3657596112" "This is an unwise decision. I will not allow you to do this."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P2975063209" "Fate will smile on me, I assure you, and when it does, you'll be dead."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P2411040896" "Just let me go or you'll regret it!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P3785918307" "Rrraagh! Enough spouting off! You're coming with us!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P1693191905" "Don't act all superior. You're nothing but a criminal. At least we fight for something."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P3348269601" "You don't scare me, lowlife."
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P286256915" "Rrraagh! Enough of your nonsense!"

// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_SYN_ALERT :
"P882842865" "Looks like I'll just have to fight you all!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_SYN_ALERT :
"P74628316" "Hope you're ready to die!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_SYN_ALERT :
"P2112712924" "Rrrraaagh! Fightin' time!"
// IMPERIAL_CITY_DES_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_SYN_ALERT :
"P2050469935" "Rrraaagh! I'm gonna tear everyone to shreds!"

