"P778867648" "You see this knife? It's goin' through your heart! Hope you're ready to die!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P1043769050" "Cole can give you weapons. White can give you training. None of that is gonna save you from us!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P792663714" "We're here to tear it all down, cop, and there is nothing you can do to stop us!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P278056896" "Doesn't matter which of us wins. We're here. One way or another, you're done for, and so's your Emperor!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_INACTIVE :
"P1930357835" "Rrrraaagh! Smashin' Cole's minions is almost as good as smashin' Cole himself!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_ALERTED :
"P3663108458" "You have no idea who you're dealing with, do you? Rrraaaghh!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_ALERTED :
"P3171335250" "Rrrraaaaagh! Enough! I will destroy everything!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_ALERTED :
"P2348079490" "This is not going to end well for you!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BATTLE_PPD_FIGHTERLOW_ALERTED :
"P3933626094" "I'm going to crush you!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE :
"P1831716470" "I've almost got it. Once we're in, we gotta be quick."
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE :
"P2147290590" "Everyone ready? There's not a lot of time to get in and out, so we gotta go as soon as I'm in."
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE :
"P802945049" "Rrraagh! This is harder than I thought! I should just bash it down!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_PICKER_INACTIVE :
"P1957261652" "The team ready? We gotta get our guys and get out. Don't mess this up!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P2362455301" "Rrrraagh! What's taking so long?"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P554050982" "We're ready to go! Let's do this!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P2262148986" "Do we look like we're the Resistance? We're soldiers. We're ready. Just get us inside!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_INACTIVE :
"P3867313006" "Just get us through the door. We'll handle the rest."

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P3505599866" "We've got a situation here! Let's deal with it before they compromise the operation!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P1644083875" "You stumbled down the wrong tunnel, whelp. Time to die!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P4073841240" "I knew this was too exposed a location! Take down this fool before the whole operation is blown."
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P2114568026" "Rrraaagh! We're gonna kill you!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BREAKIN_WATCHER_ATTACK :
"P1730359603" "So, you want to mess with the Destroyers? Big mistake! Rrrraaagh!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P3459884604" "We save the world from Hamidon and Cole's people are making monsters of their own!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P227498774" "Cole's little city hides some nasty secrets underneath. Maybe we can use that against him!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P254341635" "Rrrrrrr! I'm getting really tired of dealing with these Resistance grunts. We're here for Cole and they keep getting in the way!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P3955715740" "The Resistance has no discipline. Not like we do. We fought in the wars. We know how to win. They don't. I'm surprised they have lasted this long against Cole."
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE :
"P3302787221" "The Resistance? The Syndicate? It's no wonder Cole, White and their ilk thought they could betray us. Look at the pathetic opposition they face here."

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P3190460510" "Stickin' your nose in other people's business is only gonna get you killed, fool!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P1902508299" "We're not lettin' you get away from here alive! We can't have you tellin' Cole what you heard! Nothin' personal!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P1009323155" "Rrraaagh! You're makin' a big mistake gettin' in our way!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P2689359394" "We fought in the Wars! We're gonna do to you what we did to the Hamidon!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT :
"P3441214830" "Rrraaagh! You're gonna pay for snoopin' on us!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P545449220" "Cole and his cronies are gonna get a real nasty surprise when this goes off!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2878536211" "This is the first of many messages we're gonna send! Cole's gonna regret his betrayal!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P205138367" "Rrraaagh! Time to blow up the city!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BOMB_PLACER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2045824471" "Rrrrr! No! The bomb's almost set. Gotta keep it together!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4194552781" "We got a situation here. Set the bomb now!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2056284400" "Looks like we got someone who wants to test our bomb for us. Knock 'em out and tie 'em to the bomb!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2579184371" "This bomb is going off and there's nothing you can do to stop it!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_BOMB_LOOKOUT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2036974206" "Rrrraaagh! No! No one interferes! Cole will pay! You will pay!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P3755730442" "You have no idea what you're doing! Set me free and no one has to get hurt!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P2685355097" "You might as well just kill me. I won't tell you guys a thing."
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P3955292221" "I don't care what you do. I'm not talking."
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_ALLEYSNATCH_VICTIM_INACTIVE :
"P3879640905" "It's a warzone down here. If you know what's best for you, you'll let me go and get out of here before my side shows up."

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P758881704" "We're the Destroyers. We fought in the wars. The rest of you... you don't know real fighting. You'll shutup and tell us what we want to know."
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P3590835988" "Rrrrr! Enough stonewalling. Tell me now!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_INACTIVE :
"P1474462617" "We want revenge and you know something that'll help us get it. Like it or not, you're gonna tell us what we want to know."

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P4138458440" "Don't let them escape! Take 'em all down if you have to!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P2067045459" "Enough of this! Kill 'em all. We'll get what we need another way!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P1466464721" "Rrraaaghh! I'm gonna destroy you!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_ALLEYSNATCH_CAPTOR_ALERT :
"P598260615" "You shouldn't have gotten involved! Now you're gonna die too!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3386178587" "Cole's not showing us any mercy, so why show his people any? When we get in, take everyone out. No witnesses, no survivors."
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P815229197" "Down here, there's nothing we can't do. Cole's reach doesn't extend as far as he thinks it does."
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3265919115" "No! Keep it together! If we do something like that, we're no better than those monsters Cole's cronies are dumping down here. We're still soldiers, no matter what the Fixodine does."
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4078132692" "We've gotta draw the Resistance out into the open down here. They'll engage the cops, and we can use that opportunity to strike at both of their bases. Take 'em all down at once."

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P366501104" "Looks like we got ourselves a spy. Take 'em down before they can tell anyone what they heard!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3067400917" "Change of plans: kill the grunt!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3629578960" "Why'd you have to go stickin' your nose in? Now you're gonna have to disappear!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DESTROYERS_PLOTTING_PLOTTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P534415472" "Raaagh! I've had enough of this! The new plan: kill 'em all!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P2525526421" "You Resistance really don't get it. You've got no chance. Get out of our way and let us deal with Cole!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P345621993" "You really think you've won, don't you? Rrraaaagh! I was just getting warmed up!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_RES_INACTIVE :
"P1717728344" "We're never gonna give up, grunt! You are nothing! Cole is ours!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_FE_INACTIVE :
"P3627898256" "Bring it on, monster! I'm not dead yet!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_FE_INACTIVE :
"P714076764" "I'm not goin' down without a fight, beastie! You'll get no free meal from me!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_FE_INACTIVE :
"P1856212034" "Rrrraaagh! Time to smash the monsters!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_FE_INACTIVE :
"P2484245122" "Don't start licking your chops just yet, monster!"

// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1491088698" "You cops aren't that bright. You know how many times I've stared down death?"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P3512650653" "I survived the Wars. I'll survive this fight too!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P4121041498" "You won't win. Cole won't win! The Destroyers are coming and you cannot stop it!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P1294221156" "Rrrrraagh! I'm gonna rip your arms off!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P896676249" "I'm gonna beat that smile off your face. You ain't won this fight yet!"
// UNDERGROUND_NP_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_PPD_INACTIVE :
"P4047587864" "The Destroyers never surrender! Rrraaaagh!"
















































// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P842238851" "Rrrraagh! It's on now!"
// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P268820112" "Destroy everything!"
// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P2016720785" "Lookin' for a fight? You just found one!"
// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_RES_ALERTED :
"P3127496899" "Rrraaagh! Fightin' time!"


// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_FE_ALERTED :
"P4137709917" "Rrraaagh! I'll beat you all!"
// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_FE_ALERTED :
"P1960202813" "You're all dead now!"
// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_FE_ALERTED :
"P3515777606" "Rrrraagh! I'm gonna tear you all apart!"
// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_FE_ALERTED :
"P1828794093" "Let's do this!"



// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P4212721396" "This is the best you can muster? I'll eat you all for lunch!"
// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P647565783" "Rrrraaaggh! You haven't won yet, low-life!"
// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P4125773151" "I'm gonna enjoy punching that smug grin off your face!"
// UNDERGROUND_IC_ALLHOODS_DES_LASTSTAND_SYN_INACTIVE :
"P2698241250" "You ain't won yet, low-life. I'm just getting started!"
























































